# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact/demo form on /contact.
# Get yours (free) at https://web3forms.com. The notification destination
# email is configured in the Web3Forms dashboard, NOT here.
#
# The NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix is REQUIRED: it tells Next.js to inline this value
# into the browser bundle at build time so the client form can read it.
# A Web3Forms access key is designed to be public, so exposing it is safe.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder with your real key.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
